@baseUrl = http://localhost:5187
@team = tradecraft
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@documentVersionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@folderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a Markdown document
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_api/v1/documents?logicalPath=agents/dotnet.md&idempotencyKey=create-dotnet-agent
Content-Type: text/markdown
X-Asset-Metadata: {"kind":"agent-definition"}

# .NET Agent

Agent instructions.

### Append a compatible document version
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/versions?expectedVersion=1.0.0&bump=minor&idempotencyKey=update-dotnet-agent
Content-Type: text/markdown
X-Asset-Metadata: {"kind":"agent-definition"}

# .NET Agent

Updated agent instructions.

### Get document metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}?version=1
Accept: application/json

### Get raw document content
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/content?version=1.0.0
Accept: text/markdown

### Render a logical Markdown document
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/agents/dotnet.md
Accept: text/html

### Create a folder manifest
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_api/v1/folders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logicalPath": "skills/dotnet",
  "idempotencyKey": "create-dotnet-skills",
  "entries": [
    {
      "path": "SKILL.md",
      "documentVersionId": "{{documentVersionId}}"
    }
  ]
}

### Get a folder manifest
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_api/v1/folders/{{folderId}}?version=1
Accept: application/json

### Get a folder entry by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_folders/{{folderId}}/SKILL.md?version=1&raw=true

### Get a mounted folder entry
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/skills/dotnet/SKILL.md?version=1
Accept: text/html

### Missing document problem response
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{team}}/_api/v1/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/problem+json
